## Hi, I'm Dr Shraddha 👋 Founder of Ikshana Health

I took an unconventional path, and I wouldn't have it any other way. I'm a BNYS physician trained in Integrative Medicine, an MSc Neuroscience graduate (UK), a 2nd-gen entrepreneur and a health-tech practitioner. I work where clinical care, translational research and innovation meet.

### 🩺 Ikshana Health
